{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "balance-slider",
  "title": "平衡滑块",
  "description": "用于在左右两侧间拖动分配比例的双色平衡滑块展示组件。",
  "category": "form",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "input"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "initialValue",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "滑块的初始位置（0-100），仅初始化时生效。",
      "default": "50"
    },
    {
      "name": "leftColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "滑块左侧的背景色（六位十六进制）。",
      "default": "\"#e68a00\""
    },
    {
      "name": "rightColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "滑块右侧的背景色（六位十六进制）。",
      "default": "\"#ffffff\""
    },
    {
      "name": "minShiftLimit",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "启动位移动画的最小阈值。",
      "default": "40"
    },
    {
      "name": "maxShiftLimit",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "关闭位移动画的最大阈值。",
      "default": "68"
    },
    {
      "name": "leftContent",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "左侧提示中显示的文本。",
      "default": "\"LEFT\""
    },
    {
      "name": "rightContent",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "右侧提示中显示的文本。",
      "default": "\"RIGHT\""
    },
    {
      "name": "indicatorColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "滑块中央指示器的颜色。",
      "default": "\"#FFFFFF\""
    },
    {
      "name": "borderRadius",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "左右两块色带的圆角半径，单位 px",
      "default": "8"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\nimport { useColorMode } from \"@vueuse/core\";\nimport { computed } from \"vue\";\n\nconst isDark = computed(() => useColorMode().value == \"dark\");\nconst rightColor = computed(() => (isDark.value ? \"#FFFFFF\" : \"#000000\"));\nconst indicatorColor = computed(() => (isDark.value ? \"#FFFFFF\" : \"#000000\"));\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"w-full p-4\">\n    <BalanceSlider\n      :right-color=\"rightColor\"\n      left-content=\"COFFEE\"\n      right-content=\"MILK\"\n      :indicator-color=\"indicatorColor\"\n    />\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "展示两个选项之间的比例倾向（如示例中的 COFFEE / MILK）。",
    "落地页需要可拖动的双边对比交互区块。",
    "需要自定义左右背景色与提示文案的比例展示。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "表单中需要取值提交的数值滑块，改用 reborn-slider。",
    "需要监听滑动值变化的场景：该组件未定义任何事件，取不到当前值。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "无事件、无插槽、无 v-model，仅能通过 initialValue（0-100）设置初始位置，无法向外读取用户拖动后的值。",
    "minShiftLimit / maxShiftLimit（默认 40 / 68）控制位移动画的启停阈值，而非取值范围。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add balance-slider"
  },
